() Tj T*
(After more than three decades of work in preventive medicine and) Tj T*
(public health, the opportunity has arisen in connection with a) Tj T*
(year?s visit to America, to take a panoramic view of public health) Tj T*
(in England, of the progress which has been secured, of the factors) Tj T*
(which have impeded progress, and of the pressing desiderata for more) Tj T*
ET
