(workers to profit by English experience, to adopt what is good, to) Tj T*
(secure the abolition of the short tenure of office of competent) Tj T*
(officers under the present political system, and to introduce civil) Tj T*
(service conditions for them. There is in many respects a close) Tj T*
(parallelism between the course of public health on both sides of the) Tj T*
(Atlantic; in some cities the English hygienist has much to learn) Tj T*
(in respect of advanced and original work; and in other American) Tj T*
(cities in which ?political pull? continues, there is evidence of the) Tj T*
(development of a wider interest and a more general sense of communal) Tj T*
(responsibility; a deeper trend of thought which will make for) Tj T*
(steadily increasing efficiency in public health work. As this volume) Tj T*
(discusses public health problems especially from a social viewpoint,) Tj T*
(it is my earnest hope that it may be useful in this direction.) Tj T*
