(supervision by government inspectors, and to endorsement by the) Tj T*
(Central Authority. At first, medical assistance under the reformed) Tj T*
(Poor Law was made as deterrent as non-medical relief; and although) Tj T*
(there has been much improvement, chiefly on the institutional side,) Tj T*
(medical treatment under the Poor Law has to some extent retained this) Tj T*
