() Tj T*
(I have several times in this address mentioned the valuable work of) Tj T*
(voluntary health agencies. No official can fail to recognize that) Tj T*
(pioneer work is commonly started by them; and it has often happened) Tj T*
(that only when the evidence of its value has become obtrusive has) Tj T*
