(their relief work by preventive work; that, to use a well-known) Tj T*
(simile, they should erect a parapet at the top of a dangerous cliff) Tj T*
(as well as provide ambulances at its foot. In so doing they will, I) Tj T*
(am confident, not encroach on present successful work of existing) Tj T*
(bodies concerned with promoting child welfare, or with the prevention) Tj T*
(of tuberculosis or of venereal diseases, or with existing agencies) Tj T*
(for providing nurses for the poor. But they can supplement the) Tj T*
(efforts of these organizations; they can bring monetary as well as) Tj T*
(personal assistance; and they can, above all, bring a mass of public) Tj T*
