(progressing disease. This sometimes become spontaneously arrested;) Tj T*
(occasionally it may be arrested or its course delayed under) Tj T*
(medical treatment at home associated with manageable changes in) Tj T*
(domestic and industrial life. In still further instances it may) Tj T*
