() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(               _The Influence of Statistical Studies_) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The intensive study of our national and of local vital statistics) Tj T*
(has also had a most important bearing on the further development of) Tj T*
(maternity and child welfare work. In successive official reports) Tj T*
(it has been shown that infant mortality varies greatly in different) Tj T*
(parts of the country, irrespective of climatic conditions; that it) Tj T*
(varies greatly in different parts of the same town, in accordance) Tj T*
(with variations in respect of industrial and housing conditions, of) Tj T*
(local sanitation, of poverty and alcoholism; that the variations) Tj T*
(extend to different portions of infant life, the death-rate in) Tj T*
(infants under a week, or under a month in age, for instance, being) Tj T*
(two or three times as high in some areas as in others; and that the) Tj T*
(distribution of special diseases in infancy similarly varies greatly.) Tj T*
(Intensive studies of infant mortality on these and other lines have) Tj T*
(pointed plainly the directions in which preventive work is especially) Tj T*
(called for; and have incidentally demonstrated the fundamental value) Tj T*
(of accurate statistics of births and of deaths in the child welfare) Tj T*
(campaign. Surveys of local conditions both statistical and based) Tj T*
(on actual local observations form an indispensable preliminary to) Tj T*
(and concomitant of good child welfare work; and it is to combined) Tj T*
(work on these lines that the improvement of recent years is largely) Tj T*
(attributable. To _act helpfully_ we must _know thoroughly_ the) Tj T*
(summation of conditions which form the evil to be attacked.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(One important result of investigations such as those already) Tj T*
(mentioned has been to bring more clearly into relief the fact, which) Tj T*
(previously had been partially neglected, that _child welfare work) Tj T*
(can only succeed in so far as the welfare of the mother is also) Tj T*
(maintained_.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
